# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored; never commit real secrets.
# Nothing is required: sign-in is email + password and works without any secrets.
# Optional: Google sign-in on http://127.0.0.1:8787 (add .../api/auth/google/callback as a redirect URI).
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Optional: a dedicated GitHub OAuth app (identity/email scopes only).
# Register the exact local callback: http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/auth/github/callback
# Apply migration 0010 before enabling these values. Never commit real values.
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
